  "contentHtml": "<p>오픈채팅방에 올린 글입니다.</p><p>오픈채팅방에 올라오는 답글도 첨부하겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>선생님들 <br>이런&#160;표본,&#160;모형을&#160; <br>1)&#160;활용 <br>2)&#160;정리&#160;및&#160;폐기&#160; <br><br>해보신&#160;분&#160;계신가요?</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc3d0a01fc0a78a82a96778225f3441e30af4bad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc3d0a01fc0a78a82a96778225f3441e30af4bad\" data-orgin-width=\"1125\" data-origin-height=\"599\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb70fd4ed3eeae863368b058f906d9a9f6a828c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb70fd4ed3eeae863368b058f906d9a9f6a828c\" data-orgin-width=\"1125\" data-origin-height=\"495\"></div><p>과학실&#160;안팎&#160;정리가&#160;참&#160;어렵다...&#160;생각을&#160;하다가 <br>&#39;과학실&#160;신박한&#160;정리&#39;&#160;팀이&#160;있으면&#160;좋겠다는&#160;생각을&#160;해봅니다.&#160;누가&#160;이런&#160;거&#160;좀&#160;도와주면&#160;좋을&#160;것&#160;같아요.&#160; <br>(정리정돈도&#160;다중지능의&#160;한&#160;켠에&#160;들어가야&#160;한다고&#160;보는&#160;사람이라..&#160;그만큼&#160;저는&#160;정리가&#160;어려워요..)</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
